    "Since started out its business with a tiny pack of Chocolate, Elim Corporation has continuously worked for the good health and happiness of the nation over the past 15 year with the trust and affection shown by its consumers Striving for globalization, Elim Corporation have make its best efforts to develop new technology and establish new overseas markets during the period through its incessant R&D activities with its staff's professionalism, and finally could introduce its unique rock chocolates first in the world.\r\rAs a result of such efforts, the Company has seen the number of its oversea buyers, its international markets and its product items grown up every year fast and steadily during the latest years., and thus now have its clientele lists of 50 customer buyers over about 20 countries throughout the world.\r\rAs for its product items, Elim Corporation now manufacture and export the following four (4) categories of its product items under its own brands and enjoy the good reputations from the international buyers with the uniqueness and good quality of these items :\r\r1) Rock chocolates\r2) Seaweed lavers\r3) Honey teas.\r4) Marshmallows and Toys & Candies\r\rAiming at the No. 1 in the Company's business field, Elim Corporation and all its management and staff are still dedicating themselves to improve the quality of its products with saving to meet with the various customers' demands.\r": 1,
    "Established in 1983, DAESHIN GARDENING transformed into on agricultural coporation in January 2002.  We have contributed to forming a new catagory in the floeicultural industry, with our speciality of ceramic bonsai which is now all the rage in the market. attracting a agreat number of buyers from Canada, Singapore, Taiwan and other countries who have a great interest in pur product, we are now exporting our ceramic bonsai to the world market. \r\rin addition, we protect our products by holding industial property right. As a part of marketing campaign, we sponsor KBS TV program \"Era of Success' and 'World ceramic Biennale\". Our product quality has been highly recognized, receiving many awards, including that in Gwacheon city Tourism Souvenir Expo. \r\rCurrentiy, we are introducing a new gardening-fancy product to market and will further release a series of new products through constant R&D effects.": 1,
    "Young-Poong Co., Ltd. was founded in 1993, as an Agricultural & Livestock processed Products producer and seller; our main items are Topokki, Pork-cutlets, Korean-pancakes, Hudduk. Matdamen is meaning of \"filling taste\" and this is an unique brand of young-poong Co., Ltd. developed to adjust it to the taste of modern people.\r\rYoung-Poong Co., Ltd. try to provide simply and convenient processed food which are nutritious and safe. also, we have been keeping our own way by using fresh domestic ingredients only and pouring our devotion to make unique natural food instead of using pigments and antiseptics.\r\rOur company's domestic market has been successfully. Also, we have been exporting to Japan, U.S.A. and Hong-Kong since 1998. Through consistent oversea public relations, We take the lead in Koreans unique traditional foods Globalization and excellence.": 1,
    "NH Trading is a total farm produce trading company established by total investment of the National Agricultural Cooperative Federation (NACF), in June, 1990, to support domestic farm prices and to enlarge farmers' earnings by exporting Korean farm produce.\r  Currently, we are exporting a wide range of quality farm produces cultivated by regional cooperatives and processed foods such as Kim-chi, Citron Tea, Ginseng, etc. to over 30 countries including Japan, USA and Europe.": 1,
    "For more than 20 years Kookje Food has produced tea products and and developed high quality products to meet customers' need for fine beverages. \r\rCurrently we have more than forty products including traditional Korean tea, fusion tea, and health promoting products for home and restaurants. Kookje Food products are convenient to drink and delicious.!\r\rWe invite you to the world of Kookje Food where everyone can experience the delights of nature.": 1,
    "In order to provide the highest quality goods, since its establishment of health food manufacturer in 1992, we, Kun Yang Food Co., Ltd., have been concentrating all efforts on quality control and developing new techniques as well as using premium quality material. \r\rAs a result of continuous efforts, we could win a Gold Prize in \"The Korean Traditional Food Best 5\" contest on October 21, 2004 that organized by Korean Ministry of Agriculture with \"Korean Ginseng Root Drink\" among all drink and items in Korea. \r\rOn good reputation from customers, Kun Yang Food Co. will continue to contribute to health of people as one of premier health food manufactures in the world.": 1,
